<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4587] Discontinue and remove CacheAtomicWriteOrderMode.CLOCK mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4587</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;CacheAtomicWriteOrderMode.CLOCK&lt;/tt&gt; proved to be harmful in production due to timing issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It makes sense to remove it completely in 2.0 release. Migration guide has be updated:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/IGNITE/Apache+Ignite+2.0+Migration+Guide&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/IGNITE/Apache+Ignite+2.0+Migration+Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
